     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">You can use <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">groupClade</code> to group the <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">151</code> clade and use that info to set the linetype. For shortening <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">75</code> and <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">76</code>, you can <em>manipulate</em> their <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">x</code> position.</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important\">library(ggtree)\r\nx &lt;- read.tree(&quot;long-branch-example.newick&quot;)\r\ngroupClade(x, 151) -&gt; y\r\nggtree(y, aes(linetype=group)) + geom_tiplab(size = 2) -&gt; p\r\np$data[tree$data$node %in% c(75, 76), &quot;x&quot;] = mean(p$data$x)\r\nprint(p)\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/10c1dc9f46282/outgroup.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Inline image 1\" height=\"527\" width=\"351\"></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj48YnI+PGJyPjwvZGl2PllvdSBjYW4gdXNlIGBncm91cENsYWRlYCB0byBncm91cCB0aGUg\r\nYDE1MWAgY2xhZGUgYW5kIHVzZSB0aGF0IGluZm8gdG8gc2V0IHRoZSBsaW5ldHlwZS4gRm9yIHNo\r\nb3J0ZW5pbmcgYDc1YCBhbmQgYDc2YCwgeW91IGNhbiAqbWFuaXB1bGF0ZSogdGhlaXIgYHhgIHBv\r\nc2l0aW9uLjxicj48YnI+PGJyPjxkaXY+PGRpdj5gYGA8YnI+bGlicmFyeShnZ3RyZWUpPGJyPngg\r\nJmx0Oy0gcmVhZC50cmVlKCJsb25nLWJyYW5jaC1leGFtcGxlLm5ld2ljayIpPGJyPmdyb3VwQ2xh\r\nZGUoeCwgMTUxKSAtJmd0OyB5PGJyPmdndHJlZSh5LCBhZXMobGluZXR5cGU9Z3JvdXApKSArIGdl\r\nb21fdGlwbGFiKHNpemUgPSAyKSAtJmd0OyBwPGJyPnAkZGF0YVt0cmVlJGRhdGEkbm9kZSAlaW4l\r\nIGMoNzUsIDc2KSwgIngiXSA9IG1lYW4ocCRkYXRhJHgpPGJyPnByaW50KHApPGJyPmBgYDxicj48\r\nYnI+PGltZyBzcmM9Imh0dHBzOi8vbWFpbC5nb29nbGUuY29tL21haWwvdS8wLz91aT0yJmFtcDtp\r\naz1kZDgyODU4MzY3JmFtcDt2aWV3PWZpbWcmYW1wO3RoPTE2MWMyMzMyY2RiMTI4OTUmYW1wO2F0\r\ndGlkPTAuMSZhbXA7ZGlzcD1lbWImYW1wO3JlYWxhdHRpZD1paV8xNjFjMjMzMmNkYjEyODk1JmFt\r\ncDthdHRiaWQ9QU5HamRKOW5tdzI0aHJZRW5iTmw0MW0zdUdpR1R0R2RDXzhTejlrUzAzcUhoZi1z\r\nV3NOVmtkQnEwSklkMVZiOGxjWE9xcVdiQVM2Tl9pQTZlVzhyOGFVS0VvM1NkOUtxTElWdHJOY2oz\r\nRHZuYzJqMkpjMnlKUXpEeGpGdjdROCZhbXA7c3o9czAtbDc1JmFtcDthdHM9MTUxOTM4MTU4OTgw\r\nMyZhbXA7cm09MTYxYzIzMzJjZGIxMjg5NSZhbXA7enciIGRhdGEtc3VybD0iaHR0cHM6Ly9tYWls\r\nLmdvb2dsZS5jb20vbWFpbC91LzAvP3VpPTImYW1wO2lrPWRkODI4NTgzNjcmYW1wO3ZpZXc9Zmlt\r\nZyZhbXA7dGg9MTYxYzIzNTNkMjgwMzcwNyZhbXA7YXR0aWQ9MC4xJmFtcDtkaXNwPWVtYiZhbXA7\r\ncmVhbGF0dGlkPWlpXzE2MWMyMzMyY2RiMTI4OTUmYW1wO2F0dGJpZD1BTkdqZEpfbVNxUnhTcUl6\r\nczFVMXB6dmdJaEJKRVFDX0RXWkVNSW9jSEs1SkRWWF81YnUza0s0Y28ydEFma2N3M3JuQ2NOT